    # GRANNY_OH_DREARY "Now you'll stay young in her quiet dream."
    GRANNY_OH_DREARY "现在你会在她安静的梦里永远年轻。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1326
